" end="58.515">to</span> <span begin="58.515" end="59.534">death</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世人啊 至死方休地溺爱自己吧</span></p><p begin="59.295" end="1:02.895" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.295" end="59.525">So</span> <span begin="59.525" end="59.695">you</span> <span begin="59.695" end="1:00.085">gotta</span> <span begin="1:00.085" end="1:00.595">fire</span> <span begin="1:00.595" end="1:00.875">up,</span> <span begin="1:01.275" end="1:01.445">you</span> <span begin="1:01.445" end="1:01.865">gotta</span> <span begin="1:01.865" end="1:02.255">let</span> <span begin="1:02.255" end="1:02.895">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就燃起怒火 放手一搏</span></p><p begin="1:02.895" end="1:06.305" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.895" end="1:03.125">You&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:03.125" end="1:03.425">nev</span><span begin="1:03.425" end="1:03.505">er</span> <span begin="1:03.505" end="1:03.815">be</span> <span begin="1:03.815" end="1:04.365">loved</span> <span begin="1:04.365" end="1:04.615">&apos;til</span> <span begin="1:04.615" end="1:04.815">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:04.815" end="1:05.215">made</span> <span begin="1:05.215" end="1:05.715">your</span> <span begin="1:05.715" end="1:06.305">own</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有亲手开拓 才配拥抱所爱</span></p><p begin="1:06.305" end="1:09.655" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.305" end="1:06.465">You</span> <span begin="1:06.465" end="1:06.805">gotta</span> <span begin="1:06.805" end="1:07.365">face</span> <span begin="1:07.365" end="1:07.785">up,</span> <span begin="1:08.015" end="1:08.175">you</span> <span begin="1:08.175" end="1:08.555">gotta</span> <span begin="1:08.555" end="1:08.945">get</span> <span begin="1:08.945" end="1:09.655">yours</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直面这一切 夺回属于你的天地</span></p><p begin="1:09.495" end="1:13.285" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.495" end="