 ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寄于继父门下的悖逆孤雏</span></p><p begin="1:24.525" end="1:27.575" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.525" end="1:24.785">A</span> <span begin="1:24.785" end="1:25.285">son</span> <span begin="1:25.285" end="1:25.455">of</span> <span begin="1:25.455" end="1:25.825">a—,</span> <span begin="1:25.825" end="1:26.105">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:26.105" end="1:26.515">so</span> <span begin="1:26.515" end="1:27.225">sor</span><span begin="1:27.225" end="1:27.575">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无处容身 我满怀愧意</span></p><p begin="1:27.825" end="1:30.865" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.825" end="1:28.245">No</span> <span begin="1:28.245" end="1:29.055">lies</span> <span begin="1:29.055" end="1:29.245">and</span> <span begin="1:29.245" end="1:29.615">no</span> <span begin="1:29.615" end="1:29.875">de</span><span begin="1:29.875" end="1:30.435">ceiv</span><span begin="1:30.435" end="1:30.865">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">褪去谎言 撕下伪装</span></p><p begin="1:30.865" end="1:33.265" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.865" end="1:31.285">Man</span> <span begin="1:31.285" end="1:31.475">is</span> <span begin="1:31.475" end="1:31.745">what</span> <span begin="1:31.745" end="1:32.015">he</span> <span begin="1:32.015" end="1:33.265">loves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心之所向 塑我之魂</span></p><p begin="1:34.515" end="1:40.975" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.515" end="1:34.555">I</span> <span begin="1:34.555" end="1:34.975">keep</span> <span begin="1:34.975" end="1:35.875">tryin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:35.875" end="1:36.275">to</span> <span begin="1:36.275" end="1:36.495">con</span><span begin="1:36.495" end="1:37.175">ceive</span> <span begin="1:37.175" end="1:37.575">that</span> <span begin="1:37.575" end="1:38.055">death</span> <span begin="1:38.055" end="1:38.245">is</span> <span begin="1:38.245" end="1:38.535">from</span> <span begin="1:38.535" end="1:39.555">above</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我苦苦参悟 死神自苍穹俯瞰降临</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:39.555" end="1:40.975"><span begin="1:39.555" end="1:39.885">(No</span> <span begin="1:39.885" end="1:40.975">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大限将至</span></span></p><p begin="1:41.215" end="1:47.725" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.215" end="1:41.345">I</span> <span begin="1:41.345" end="1:41.685">get</span> <span begin="1:41.685" end="1:42.455">mine</span> <span begin="1:42.455" end="1:42.645">and</span> <span begin="1:42.645" end="1:42.935">make</span> <span begin="1:42.935" end="1:43.295">no</span> <span begin="1:43.295" end="1:43.365">ex</span><span begin="1:43.365" end="1:43.735">cus</span><span begin="1:43.735" end="1:44.285">es</span> <span begin="1:44.285" end="1:44.765">waste</span> <span begin="1:44.765" end="1:44.955">of</span> <span begin="1:44.955" end="1:45.325">pre</span><span begin="1:45.325" end="1:45.525">cious</span> <span begin="1:45.525" end="1:46.355">breath</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我领受命运也绝不辩解 那纯属徒费唇舌</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:46.355" end="1:47.725"><span begin="1:46.355" end="1:46.625">(No</span> <span begin="1:46.625" end="1:47.725">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时不我与</span></span></p><p begin="1:47.935" end="1:50.255" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.935" end="1:48.035">The</span> <span begin="1:48.035" end="1:48.415">sun</span> <span begin="1:48.415" end="1:49.225">shines</span> <span begin="1:49.225" end="1:49.435">on</span> <span begin="1:49.435" end="1:49.585">ev</span><span begin="1:49.585" end="1:49.785">ery</span><span begin="1:49.785" end="1:50.255">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烈日平等映照万物苍生</span></p><p begin="1:50.255" end="1:53.075" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.255" end="1:50.40